{"id":"manera","lemma":"manera","pos":"noun","rank":227,"glosses":["way; manner; method; style"],"ipa":"/maˈneɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"maneras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-manera.wav","formAudio":{"maneras":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-maneras.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Hazlo de esta manera.","en":"Do it this way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440615"},{"text":"Podemos idear algunas maneras de huir.","en":"We must devise some means of escape.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804589"},{"text":"Debe haber una manera.","en":"There has to be a way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461801"},{"text":"La lengua puede usarse de muchas maneras.","en":"Language can be used in many ways.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1155875"},{"text":"Tom cantó de manera suave.","en":"Tom sang softly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800161"}]}